---
// Table-driven tests with t.Run subtests, httptest recorder, and Go's built-in -race detector.
const W = 900;
const H = 278;
---
<figure class="gf3d">
  <div class="gf3d-scroll">
    <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Anatomy of idiomatic Go table-driven unit tests using t.Run subtests, httptest handlers, and go test -race data race detection.">
      {/* Left panel: Table-driven pattern */}
      <rect x="14" y="14" width="440" height="250" rx="10" class="gf3d-card" />
      <text x="30" y="42" class="gf3d-h">
        <tspan data-lang-en>1. Idiomatic Table-Driven Tests (*_test.go)</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>1. Mẫu Unit Test chuẩn Go: Table-Driven Tests</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="30" y="60" width="408" height="72" rx="6" class="gf3d-box" />
      <text x="44" y="80" class="gf3d-b">cases := []struct {'{'} name string; fail bool; wantErr error {'}'}</text>
      <text x="44" y="99" class="gf3d-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Add edge cases as rows — zero duplicated assert boilerplate.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Thêm case mới bằng 1 dòng — không copy lại khung test.</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="44" y="117" class="gf3d-m">Lives right next to foo.go as foo_test.go (excluded from prod build).</text>

      <rect x="30" y="142" width="408" height="110" rx="6" class="gf3d-box is-ok" />
      <text x="44" y="162" class="gf3d-b-ok">for _, tc := range cases {'{'} t.Run(tc.name, func(t *testing.T) {'{'} ... {'}'}) {'}'}</text>
      <text x="44" y="182" class="gf3d-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>• t.Run reports failing case name cleanly in IDE &amp; CI logs.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>• t.Run in đích danh tên test case hỏng (VD: /wrapped_missing).</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="44" y="201" class="gf3d-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>• Re-run 1 subtest via: go test -run TestFoo/wrapped_missing .</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>• Chạy lại đúng 1 case lỗi cực nhanh bằng cờ -run TestX/subtest.</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="44" y="220" class="gf3d-m">• Put setup teardown in t.Cleanup() instead of fragile globals.</text>

      {/* Right panel: Race detector & httptest */}
      <rect x="470" y="14" width="416" height="250" rx="10" class="gf3d-card" />
      <text x="486" y="42" class="gf3d-h">
        <tspan data-lang-en>2. Catching Silent Races &amp; HTTP Testing</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>2. Bắt lỗi tranh chấp bộ nhớ (-race) &amp; httptest</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="486" y="60" width="384" height="84" rx="6" class="gf3d-box is-red" />
      <text x="500" y="80" class="gf3d-b-red">ALWAYS run CI with:  go test -race ./...</text>
      <text x="500" y="100" class="gf3d-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Concurrent writes to 1 var pass `go test`, yet corrupt data!</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Hai luồng ghi biến chung vẫn lọt `go test`, rồi hỏng ngầm!</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="500" y="118" class="gf3d-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>`-race` catches exact conflicting lines immediately in CI.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Cờ `-race` chỉ rõ đúng 2 dòng code đụng độ ngay trên CI.</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="486" y="154" width="384" height="98" rx="6" class="gf3d-box is-ok" />
      <text x="500" y="174" class="gf3d-b-ok">net/http/httptest — zero open TCP sockets needed</text>
      <text x="500" y="194" class="gf3d-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>req := httptest.NewRequest("GET", "/health", nil)</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>rec := httptest.NewRecorder(); handler(rec, req)</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="500" y="213" class="gf3d-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Asserts HTTP status, headers, and JSON body in microseconds.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Test thẳng HTTP Handler trong bộ nhớ với tốc độ micro-giây.</tspan>
      </text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Standard library testing needs zero third-party frameworks: organize inputs in a slice of structs with t.Run subtests, exercise HTTP handlers via httptest, and gate merges on go test -race.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Go cài sẵn toàn bộ công cụ viết test không cần framework nặng: gom dữ liệu đầu vào vào bảng slice kết hợp t.Run, test API không cần mở cổng bằng httptest, và luôn chạy go test -race trước khi merge code.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .gf3d { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .gf3d-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .gf3d svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .gf3d text { font-size: 12px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .gf3d-card { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .gf3d-box { fill: var(--bg); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .gf3d-box.is-red { stroke: var(--red); fill: var(--red-tint-bg); }
  .gf3d-box.is-ok { stroke: rgb(21, 128, 61); }
  :global(html[data-theme='dark']) .gf3d-box.is-ok { stroke: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  .gf3d-h { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .gf3d-b { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .gf3d-b-red { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--red); }
  .gf3d-b-ok { font-weight: 700; fill: rgb(21, 128, 61); }
  :global(html[data-theme='dark']) .gf3d-b-ok { fill: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  .gf3d-m { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 11px; }
  .gf3d figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
